<title>PORTUGAL: Lisbon bourse trade still halted, prices incorrect.</title>
<headline>Lisbon bourse trade still halted, prices incorrect.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share trade on the Lisbon bourse was being delayed on Wednesday by technical problems and prices displayed on screens are incorrect, a bourse spokesman said.</p>
<p>The bourse had earlier said that trade would begin at 1100 GMT. The spokesman gave no details of the technical problems.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
